      "content": "Since this headache was an explosive, sudden onset and feels much worse than your typical migraines, you should be very cautious. While sumatriptan might help your usual migraines, a sudden, severe headache warrants a more immediate check-up. I strongly recommend you seek professional medical advice right away to rule out anything serious.",
